  "arm": "0 -- recipe unchanged; the 14 PHerc0139 representations (9 aligned + 5 native) removed from training; quotas renormalised {1667: 40, Paris4: 20, 0814: 4} of batch 64; 78,125 iterations; checkpoints every 5,000",
